# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Also add the two VITE_ vars to the Vercel project env.
# Supabase dashboard > Project Settings > API: project URL and the publishable key
# (sb_publishable_...; the legacy anon key also works).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional: the TV's background music. A YouTube playlist id (the list= part of its link) and one
# or more video ids of "Ein Prosit" (comma-separated, best first). Defaults are in src/tv/music.ts.
# VITE_MUSIC_PLAYLIST=
# VITE_PROSIT_VIDEO=

# Optional: "off" silences Der Herold, the TV's speech-synthesis announcer.
# VITE_HEROLD=
